  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK-granskning (Intern styrning och kontroll) HEPS 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control review HEPS 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser ISK-granskning (Intern styrning och kontroll) av organisationen Coalition for Health Promotion and Social Development (HEPS Uganda), i syfte att bed&#xf6;ma organisationens interna styrning och kontroll. Konsulten skall identifiera eventuella svagheter.  Utifr&#xe5;n ISK-granskningens slutsatser kommer Sida att kr&#xe4;va att n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga &#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder vidtas innan eller under avtalsperioden. &#xc5;tg&#xe4;rder kan komma att inkluderas som avtalsvillkor och f&#xf6;ljas upp inom ramen f&#xf6;r den &#xe5;rliga revisionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control review of the organisation Coalition for Health Promotion and Social Development (HEPS Uganda). The review aims at assessing the system for internal control of HEPS. The consultant is expected to identify eventual weaknesses. Based on the findings, Sida will require that the organisation addresses the weaknesses as appropriate before or during the agreement phase. Some of the measures might be included as agreement conditions to be followed up during the annual audit.</narrative>
  </description>
